 "stimulus_html": "Use  the same Venn diagram in the example above to answer the following questions.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 497895,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How many people donated blood with a type B blood factor?\n\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"n(B) = n(A{B^ + }) + n(A{B^ - }) + n({B^ + }) + n({B^ - }) = 14\">n(B) = n(A{B^ + }) + n(A{B^ - }) + n({B^ + }) + n({B^ - }) = 14</span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Count every blood type that has any type of B as part of the blood type.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"n(B) = n(A{B^ + }) + n(A{B^ - }) + n({B^ + }) + n({B^ - }) = 3 + 1 + 8 + 2 = 14\"></span></p>\n"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 497896,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How many people who donated blood did not have a type B blood factor?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p> <span data-math=\"n({B^\\prime }) = n(U) - n(B) = 86\">n({B^\\prime }) = n(U) - n(B) = 86</span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>You could count every type that does not have a B as part of the blood type. However, if you did the previous exercise, you already know the complement of B.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"n\\left( {B'} \\right) = n\\left( U \\right) - n(B) = 100 - 14 = 86\"></span></p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 497897,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "How many people who donated blood had a type B blood factor or were Rh<sup>+</sup>?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"n(B \\cup R{h^ + }) = 87\">n(B \\cup R{h^ + }) = 87</span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Count the number of people who are in either the B circle or the RH<sup>+</sup> circles.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1 + 3 + 2 + 8 + 36 + 37 = 87\"></span></p>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
